silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_05_probe_ungated_render_concrete_anchor_2#witnessafteringest a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.01_orientation.chapters.13_regression_test_suite.sections.05_probe_ungated_render.concrete_anchor_2#witnessafteringest" .
silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_05_probe_ungated_render_concrete_anchor_2#witnessafteringest silm:hasLongDescription "The WitnessAfterIngest is Witness is the second node in the R5 five-arrow publish chain. For the Mittens measurement fixture, the SourcePhrase \"Mittens measured at 4.1kg on 2024-11-01\" becomes the Witness object after ingest assigns provenance (path: vet/MittensVisit2024-11-01.json, lines 12-14). The witness still has no olog sort and no validation gate clearance — it carries the raw 4.1kg reading and date string but no MeasurementEvent2024 typing yet." .
